        No no aspetta io sono <b><i>{charNameOne}</b></i>.#speaker:{firstChar_tag()} #inkA:{ink_tag_a(firstChar_InkLevel)} #inkB:{ink_tag_b(firstChar_InkLevel)}  #inkC:{ink_tag_c(firstChar_InkLevel)}  #inkD:{ink_tag_d(firstChar_InkLevel)}  #ewWord:{em_state(Influenced)} #portrait:chitarra_annoyed
